  <History Date="25-04-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="14-01-13" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Corrected P/T Macro ranges." />
  <History Date="11-02-14" Author="RGB Power on Updater" Comment="Updated RGB Power on values to match Locate." />
  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="11-06-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added physical pan/tilt limits.  Increased wheel resolution.  Fixed shutter." />
  <History Date="11-06-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed 14 DMX mode mapping (was RGBW instead of multi-cell col macro)." />
  <History Date="11-06-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed colour macro functions to variable ranges.  Added missing 12 channel mode." />
  <History Date="11-06-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised cell layout." />
  <History Date="16-09-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Prolight elumen8 Kudos 120 (effectively identical.  poor documentation)" />
  <History Date="17-09-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." />
